:"2026-09-01T11:39:48.189Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f65","name":"Payslip August.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f64"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-01T11:39:48.189Z","createdTime":"2026-08-31T11:39:48.189Z","size":48},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: Payslip August.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f66","name":"Payslip September.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f64"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-01T12:39:48.189Z","createdTime":"2026-09-30T12:39:48.189Z","size":51},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: Payslip September.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f67","name":"Budget 2026.md","folder":false,"parents":["f55"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-27T17:39:48.189Z","createdTime":"2026-09-26T17:39:48.189Z","size":443},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Monthly budget for 2026: rent, bills, food and £600 savings a month.\ntags: [money]\nkind: Budget\nyear: 2026\n---\n\n## Current state\n- September came in £120 under budget, mostly on groceries.\n\n## Each month\n\n| | Planned |\n| --- | --- |\n| Rent | £1,450 |\n| Bills | £180 |\n| Food | £400 |\n| Savings | £600 |\n\n## October\n\n- [x] Move £600 to savings\n- [ ] Cancel the old gym membership\n\n## Timeline\n- 4 Oct · September receipts counted.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f68","name":"Health","folder":true,"parents":["f45"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-05T17:39:48.189Z","createdTime":"2026-09-05T17:39:48.189Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f69","name":"Health.md","folder":false,"parents":["f68"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-05T17:39:48.189Z","createdTime":"2026-09-04T17:39:48.189Z","size":303,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: GP, dentist, blood tests and the physio routine.\ntags: [health]\nby: bower\nkind: Area\n---\n\n## Current state\n- Dentist check-up on 14 October.\n- Blood test in May was normal.\n\nPhysio routine in [[Physio exercises]].\n\n## Timeline\n- 20 May · Blood test results filed. · [[Blood test, May