er, Ferrowick]] | 7 | new |\n\n## This week\n\n- [x] Update the CV with the migration project\n- [ ] Prepare the Lumenfold interview story\n- [ ] Chase Quillstone\n\n## Timeline\n- 15 Sep · Project started.\n- 1 Oct · Applied to Lumenfold; fit scored against [[CV insights]].\n- 3 Oct · Interview invitation from Lumenfold. · [[Interview invitation.pdf]]\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f25","name":"CV 2026.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f23"],"modifiedTime":"2026-08-26T13:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-08-25T13:39:48.222Z","size":41},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: CV 2026.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f26","name":"Applications","folder":true,"parents":["f23"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-02T08:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-10-02T08:39:48.222Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f27","name":"Design Lead, Quillstone.md","folder":false,"parents":["f26"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-24T18:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-23T18:39:48.222Z","size":481,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Design lead for a kitchenware range at Quillstone; applied 23 Sep, no answer yet.\nstatus: applied\ntags: [job]\nby: bower\nkind: Job offer\ncompany: Quillstone\nsalary: £70,000\nfit: 6 out of 10\n---\n\n## Current state\n- Applied on 23 September; no answer in 11 days.\n- More management than hands-on design; missing team-lead experience.\n\nFound through a recruiter. The role reports to the head of product.\n\n## Timeline\n- 23 Sep · Applied; fit scored against [[CV insights]].\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f28","name":"Industrial Designer, Ferrowick.md","folder":false,"parents":["f26"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-20T12:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-19T12:39:48.222Z","size":452,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Industrial designer offer from Ferrowick, £54,000, fully remote; new, not yet answered.\nstatus: new\ntags: [job]\nby: bower\nkind: Job offer\ncompany: Ferrowick\nsalary: £66,000\nfit: 7 out of 10\nwhere: Remote\n---\n\n## Current state\n- Offer letter received; answer expected within two weeks.\n- Good match on prototyping and materials; less client work than Alex wants.\n\n## Timeline\n- 15 Sep · Job advert saved and scored against [[CV insights]].\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f29","name":"Senior Product Designer, Lumenfold.md","folder":false,"parents":["f26"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-02T08:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-10-01T08:39:48.222Z","size":848,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Senior product designer role at Lumenfold, applied 1 Oct, first interview on Thursday.\nstatus: interview\ntags: [job]\nby: bower\nkind: Job offer\ncompany: Lumenfold Studio\nsalary: £68,000 to £75,000\nfit: 8 out of 10\nwhere: Hybrid, 2 days in the office\n---\n\n## Current state\n- First interview on Thursday at 10:00, video call.\n- Strong match on lighting and furniture work; weaker on the medical devices experience they ask for.\n\n## Why it fits\n\n- Leads client projects, as in the last two roles\n- Asks for 3D modelling and rapid prototyping\n\n## To prepare\n\n- [x] Read their last two case studies\n- [ ] A short story about the desk lamp redesign\n- [ ] Questions about travel\n\n## Timeline\n- 1 Oct · Applied; fit scored against [[CV insights]].\n- 3 Oct · Interview invitation filed; status set to \"interview\". · [[Interview invitation.pdf]]\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f30","name":"CV insights.md","folder":false,"parents":["f23"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-28T13:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-27T13:39:48.222Z","size":636,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: What the CV shows and what job offers keep asking for: the base for every fit score.\ntags: [career]\nby: bower\noriginal: Projects/Job hunt/CV 2026.pdf\nkind: Profile\n---\n\n## Current state\n- Strong: client projects, 3D modelling, prototyping, mentoring.\n- Gaps asked for in 3 of the last 5 offers: design for manufacture, sustainable materials.\n\n## Skills asked for most\n\n| Skill | Offers asking | On the CV |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 3D modelling | 5 | yes |\n| Design for manufacture | 3 | no |\n| Sustainable materials | 3 | no |\n| Client presentations | 4 | yes |\n\n## Timeline\n- 1 Oct · Tally updated with the Lumenfold offer.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f31","name":"Flat hunt","folder":true,"parents":["f22"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-04T11:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-10-04T11:39:48.222Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f32","name":"Flat hunt.md","folder":false,"parents":["f31"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-04T11:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-10-03T11:39:48.222Z","size":1208,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Looking for a two-bed under £1,600 within 30 minutes of the office, moving by 1 December.\nstatus: active\ntags: [project]\nby: bower\nkind: Project\ndue: 1 Dec\nbudget: Up to £1,600 a month\n---\n\n## Current state\n- Three flats on the shortlist; [[Flat 3, 12 Larkspur Lane]] is the favourite.\n- References are due on Friday.\n- Notice on the current flat must be given by 31 October.\n\n## What matters\n\n- Two bedrooms, one usable as an office\n- Under 30 minutes to work\n- A bike can go inside\n\n## Shortlist\n\n| Flat | Rent | Commute | Status |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [[Flat 3, 12 Larkspur Lane]] | £1,450 | 24 min | viewing done |\n| [[Flat 7, Cobble Row]] | £1,580 | 18 min | viewing booked |\n| [[Flat 2, 40 Tanners Walk]] | £1,390 | 35 min | maybe |\n\n## Next steps\n\n- [x] Ask the bank for a reference letter\n- [ ] Send references to Kittiwake Lettings by Friday\n- [ ] Give notice on the current flat by 31 October\n- [ ] Book a van for the last weekend of November\n\n## Timeline\n- 28 Sep · Project started from a pile with three listings.\n- 2 Oct · Viewing photos of Larkspur Lane filed. · [[IMG_2290.jpg]]\n- Today · Larkspur Lane moved to \"viewing done\"; references due Friday. · [[Lease draft.pdf]]\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f33","name":"Viewing photos","folder":true,"parents":["f31"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-23T11:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-23T11:39:48.222Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f34","name":"IMG_2290.jpg","folder":false,"parents":["f33"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-23T11:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-22T11:39:48.222Z","size":44},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up image for the demo: IMG_2290.jpg.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f35","name":"IMG_2291.jpg","folder":false,"parents":["f33"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-23T11:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-22T11:39:48.222Z","size":44},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up image for the demo: IMG_2291.jpg.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f36","name":"IMG_2292.jpg","folder":false,"parents":["f33"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-23T11:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-22T11:39:48.222Z","size":44},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up image for the demo: IMG_2292.jpg.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f37","name":"Lease draft.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f31"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-26T10:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-25T10:39:48.222Z","size":45},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: Lease draft.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f38","name":"Flat 7, Cobble Row.md","folder":false,"parents":["f31"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-04T11:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-10-03T11:39:48.222Z","size":714,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Top-floor two-bed with a balcony, £1,580 a month, 18 minutes to work; viewing on Thursday.\nstatus: viewing booked\ntags: [flat, shortlist]\nby: bower\nkind: Flat\nrent: £1,580 a month\nbedrooms: 2\ncommute: 18 min\nagent: Hollin & Rowe\n---\n\n## Current state\n- Viewing on Thursday at 18:30.\n- Closest to work, but the top floor has no lift.\n\n## Before the viewing\n\n- [ ] Check the water pressure upstairs\n- [ ] Ask about the service charge\n- [ ] Measure the second bedroom for a desk\n\n## Timeline\n- 1 Oct · Listing saved; viewing booked for Thursday. · [[cobble-row-listing.example]]\n- Today · Lease terms compared. · [[Lease draft.pdf|Lease copy.pdf]]\n- Today · Viewing photos compared. · [[Viewing photos]]\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f39","name":"Flat 2, 40 Tanners Walk.md","folder":false,"parents":["f31"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-29T09:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-28T09:39:48.222Z","size":543,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Cheapest option at £1,390 a month, but 35 minutes to work; kept as a fallback.\nstatus: maybe\ntags: [flat]\nby: bower\nbower_source: web\nkind: Flat\nrent: £1,390 a month\nbedrooms: 2\ncommute: 35 min\n---\n\n## Current state\n- Over the 30-minute limit set in [[Flat hunt]]; kept in case the others fall through.\n\nGround floor with a small garden. Damp mentioned in two reviews of the building.\n\n## Timeline\n- 28 Sep · Listing saved from the first pile of the flat hunt.\n\n## Bower's note\nTwo reviews of the building mention damp in winter.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f40","name":"Flat 3, 12 Larkspur Lane.md","folder":false,"parents":["f31"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-04T11:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-10-03T11:39:48.222Z","size":1204,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Two-bed flat near the station, £1,450 a month, viewing done, waiting on the agent.\nstatus: viewing done\ntags: [flat, shortlist]\nby: bower\noriginal: Projects/Flat hunt/Lease draft.pdf\nbower_source: both\nkind: Flat\nrent: £1,450 a month\nbedrooms: 2\ncommute: 24 min\nagent: Kittiwake Lettings\n---\n\n## Current state\n- Viewed on Saturday. Bright, quiet street, small second bedroom.\n- The agent asked for references by Friday.\n- Cheapest of the three for its size; the lease has a 12-month break clause.\n\n## Notes from the viewing\n\n- Boiler replaced last year\n- Washing machine stays\n- Parking permit costs £90 a year\n\n## To ask the agent\n\n- [x] Are bills included?\n- [ ] Can we paint the second bedroom?\n- [ ] Is there storage for two bikes?\n\nCompare with [[Flat 7, Cobble Row]] and [[Flat 2, 40 Tanners Walk]].\n\n## Timeline\n- 29 Sep · Listing saved; rent and agent filled in. · [[flat-listing.example]]\n- 2 Oct · Viewing photos added. · [[IMG_2290.jpg]]\n- Today · Lease draft read: 12-month break clause, deposit of five weeks. · [[Lease draft.pdf]]\n\n## Bower's note\nThe listing does not say whether bills are included. Similar flats on the same street ask £1,500 to £1,600, so the rent is fair.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f41","name":"Saltmere weekend","folder":true,"parents":["f22"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-15T10:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-15T10:39:48.222Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f42","name":"Flights.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f41"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-14T14:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-13T14:39:48.222Z","size":41},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: Flights.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f43","name":"Hotel booking.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f41"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-14T14:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-13T14:39:48.222Z","size":47},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: Hotel booking.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f44","name":"Saltmere weekend.md","folder":false,"parents":["f41"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-15T10:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-14T10:39:48.222Z","size":509,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Long weekend in Saltmere, 7 to 10 November: flights and hotel booked.\nstatus: active\ntags: [travel]\nby: bower\nkind: Trip\ndates: 7 to 10 Nov\n---\n\n## Current state\n- Flights and hotel booked; nothing else planned yet.\n\n## Packing\n\n- [ ] Passport\n- [ ] Adapter\n- [x] Walking shoes\n- [ ] Book for the plane\n\n## Ideas\n\n- The cliff railway early in the morning\n- Dinner by the harbour\n\n## Timeline\n- 13 Sep · Flights booked. · [[Flights.pdf]]\n- 13 Sep · Hotel booked, 3 nights. · [[Hotel booking.pdf]]\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f45","name":"Areas","folder":true,"parents":["f1"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2025-08-31T18:39:48.222Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f46","name":"Car","folder":true,"parents":["f45"],"modifiedTime":"2026-08-16T09:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-08-16T09:39:48.222Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f47","name":"Car.md","folder":false,"parents":["f46"],"modifiedTime":"2026-08-16T09:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-08-15T09:39:48.222Z","size":320,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: The car: insurance until June, MOT due in January.\ntags: [car]\nby: bower\nkind: Area\n---\n\n## Current state\n- Insurance runs until 30 June.\n- MOT due in January.\n\n## Due\n\n- [ ] Book the MOT for January\n- [ ] Check the tyres before winter\n\n## Timeline\n- 15 Aug · Insurance 2026 filed. · [[Insurance 2026.pdf]]\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f48","name":"Insurance 2026.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f46"],"modifiedTime":"2026-08-16T09:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-08-15T09:39:48.222Z","size":48},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: Insurance 2026.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f49","name":"MOT certificate.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f46"],"modifiedTime":"2026-07-02T13:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-07-01T13:39:48.222Z","size":49},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: MOT certificate.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f50","name":"Home","folder":true,"parents":["f45"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-15T10:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-15T10:39:48.222Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f51","name":"Home.md","folder":false,"parents":["f50"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-15T10:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-14T10:39:48.222Z","size":414,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: The current flat: services, appliances and what is due.\ntags: [home]\nby: bower\nkind: Area\n---\n\n## Current state\n- Boiler serviced in September; next service September 2027.\n- Dishwasher warranty runs until March 2027.\n\n## Due\n\n- [x] Boiler service\n- [ ] Bleed the radiators before winter\n- [ ] Renew contents insurance in January\n\n## Timeline\n- 14 Sep · Boiler service filed. · [[Boiler invoice.pdf]]\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f52","name":"Boiler service.md","folder":false,"parents":["f50"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-15T10:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-14T10:39:48.222Z","size":418,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Yearly boiler service, last done 14 Sep by Fenwright Heating, next due September 2027.\ntags: [home]\nby: bower\noriginal: Areas/Home/Boiler invoice.pdf\nkind: Service\nnext: Sep 2027\ncost: £95\n---\n\n## Current state\n- Serviced 14 Sep; no faults. Pressure topped up.\n\nThe engineer suggested bleeding the radiators before winter.\n\n## Timeline\n- 14 Sep · Invoice filed and next date set. · [[Boiler invoice.pdf]]\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f53","name":"Boiler invoice.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f50"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-15T10:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-14T10:39:48.222Z","size":48},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: Boiler invoice.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f54","name":"Dishwasher warranty.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f50"],"modifiedTime":"2026-07-27T12:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-07-26T12:39:48.222Z","size":53},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: Dishwasher warranty.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f55","name":"Money","folder":true,"parents":["f45"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-03T15:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-10-03T15:39:48.222Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f56","name":"Money.md","folder":false,"parents":["f55"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-03T15:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-10-02T15:39:48.222Z","size":300,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Budget, payslips and receipts, 