":false,"parents":["f68"],"modifiedTime":"2026-05-28T10:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-05-27T10:39:48.222Z","size":49},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: Blood test, May.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f71","name":"Physio exercises.md","folder":false,"parents":["f68"],"modifiedTime":"2026-08-21T11:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-08-20T11:39:48.222Z","size":223},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Daily knee exercises from the physio, 10 minutes.\ntags: [health]\nkind: Routine\n---\n\n## Every morning\n\n- [x] Wall sit, 3 × 30 s\n- [x] Step-ups, 2 × 12\n- [ ] Single-leg balance, 3 × 30 s\n- [ ] Stretch, 2 minutes\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f72","name":"Documents","folder":true,"parents":["f45"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-20T12:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-20T12:39:48.222Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f73","name":"Passport copy.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f72"],"modifiedTime":"2026-08-06T16:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-08-05T16:39:48.222Z","size":47},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: Passport copy.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f74","name":"Passport renewal.md","folder":false,"parents":["f72"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-20T12:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-19T12:39:48.222Z","size":576,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Documents for the passport renewal due in March: 4 of 7 ready.\nstatus: in progress\ntags: [documents]\nby: bower\nkind: Checklist\ndue: 1 Mar\n---\n\n## Current state\n- 4 of 7 things ready.\n- The witness for the photo form must have known Alex for two years.\n\n## To send\n\n- [x] Old passport\n- [x] Two new photos\n- [x] Proof of address\n- [x] Application form, filled in\n- [ ] Photo form signed by a witness\n- [ ] Fee paid\n- [ ] Appointment booked\n\n## Timeline\n- 5 Aug · Passport copy filed; numbers left out. · [[Passport copy.pdf]]\n- 4 Oct · Application form filled in.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f75","name":"Resources","folder":true,"parents":["f1"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2025-08-31T18:39:48.222Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f76","name":"Ideas","folder":true,"parents":["f75"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-25T14:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-25T14:39:48.222Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f77","name":"Weekend projects.md","folder":false,"parents":["f76"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-25T14:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-24T14:39:48.222Z","size":189},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Small things to do on free weekends.\nkind: List\n---\n\n- [ ] Fix the bike's back brake\n- [x] Print the Saltmere photos\n- [ ] Shelf for the hallway\n- [ ] Try the sourdough recipe\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f78","name":"Cooking","folder":true,"parents":["f75"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-04T11:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-10-04T11:39:48.222Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f79","name":"Lemon tart.md","folder":false,"parents":["f78"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-02T18:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-01T18:39:48.222Z","size":170},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: A lemon tart for six, written down from a friend.\ntags: [recipe]\nkind: Recipe\n---\n\nBlind-bake the case 15 minutes; the filling sets in 25 minutes at 160 °C.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f80","name":"Weeknight curry.md","folder":false,"parents":["f78"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.332Z","createdTime":"2026-10-03T11:39:48.222Z","size":491,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: A 30-minute chickpea and spinach curry for four.\ntags: [recipe, vegetarian]\nby: bower\nkind: Recipe\ntime: 30 min\nserves: 4\n---\n\n## Ingredients\n\n- [ ] 2 tins of chickpeas\n- [ ] 200 g spinach\n- [ ] 1 tin of coconut milk\n- [ ] Curry paste, onion, garlic\n\n## Method\n\n1. Soften the onion and garlic.\n2. Fry the paste for a minute.\n3. Add chickpeas and coconut milk; simmer 15 minutes.\n4. Stir in the spinach.\n\n## Timeline\n- Today · Saved from a clipping. · [[curry-clipping.example]]\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f81","name":"Sourdough, the short version.md","folder":false,"parents":["f78"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-10T08:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-09T08:39:48.222Z","size":322,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: A same-day sourdough loaf, 7 hours from mixing to baking.\ntags: [recipe, baking]\nby: bower\nkind: Recipe\ntime: 7 h\n---\n\n1. Mix 500 g flour, 350 g water, 100 g starter, 10 g salt.\n2. Four folds, 30 minutes apart.\n3. Shape, rest 2 hours, bake 45 minutes at 240 °C.\n\n## Timeline\n- 9 Sep · Saved from a blog post.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f82","name":"Manuals","folder":true,"parents":["f75"],"modifiedTime":"2026-07-07T15:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-07-07T15:39:48.222Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f83","name":"Router setup.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f82"],"modifiedTime":"2026-06-07T14:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-06-06T14:39:48.222Z","size":46},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: Router setup.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f84","name":"Dishwasher manual.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f82"],"modifiedTime":"2026-07-07T15:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-07-06T15:39:48.222Z","size":51},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: Dishwasher manual.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f85","name":"Reading","folder":true,"parents":["f75"],"modifiedTime":"2026-08-06T16:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-08-06T16:39:48.222Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f86","name":"Notes that grow.md","folder":false,"parents":["f85"],"modifiedTime":"2026-08-06T16:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-08-05T16:39:48.222Z","size":233},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Notes on the book: write in your own words and link each note to others.\ntags: [reading]\nkind: Book\nauthor: Ida Marrow\n---\n\n- One idea per note\n- Link before you file\n- See also [[Clipping, Four folders for everything]]\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f87","name":"Clipping, Four folders for everything.md","folder":false,"parents":["f85"],"modifiedTime":"2026-07-22T10:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-07-21T10:39:48.222Z","size":209},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: A clipped article on PARA: projects, areas, resources and archive.\ntags: [reading]\nkind: Clipping\n---\n\nProjects have an end; areas go on; resources are for later; the archive is for what is done.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f88","name":"Archive","folder":true,"parents":["f1"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2025-08-31T18:39:48.222Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f89","name":"Trips","folder":true,"parents":["f88"],"modifiedTime":"2025-12-09T08:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2025-12-09T08:39:48.222Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f90","name":"Brackwater 2025.md","folder":false,"parents":["f89"],"modifiedTime":"2025-12-09T08:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2025-12-08T08:39:48.222Z","size":321,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Four days in Porto in May 2025: what we spent and what we liked.\nstatus: done\ntags: [travel]\nby: bower\nkind: Trip\n---\n\n## Current state\n- Spent £740 in total.\n\nThe old salt works were the highlight; the boat trip was skippable.\n\n## Timeline\n- 30 May 2025 · Receipts filed. · [[Brackwater 2025 receipts.pdf]]\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f91","name":"Brackwater 2025 receipts.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f89"],"modifiedTime":"2025-12-09T08:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2025-12-08T08:39:48.222Z","size":58},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: Brackwater 2025 receipts.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f92","name":"Old flat","folder":true,"parents":["f88"],"modifiedTime":"2025-08-31T12:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2025-08-31T12:39:48.222Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f93","name":"Deposit return.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f92"],"modifiedTime":"2025-09-20T09:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2025-09-19T09:39:48.222Z","size":48},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: Deposit return.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f94","name":"Inventory, Hatchmere Road.md","folder":false,"parents":["f92"],"modifiedTime":"2025-08-31T12:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2025-08-30T12:39:48.222Z","size":268},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Check-out inventory of the previous flat; deposit returned in full.\nstatus: done\ntags: [home]\nkind: Inventory\n---\n\n## Current state\n- Deposit returned in full on 2 September 2025.\n\n## Timeline\n- 2 Sep 2025 · Deposit return filed. · [[Deposit return.pdf]]\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f95","name":"About me.md","folder":false,"parents":["f1"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-05T17:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-09-04T17:39:48.222Z","size":477},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Who Alex is, what matters now and how Bower should write.\nkind: Profile\n---\n\nAlex is an industrial designer in Wrenmouth and lives with a partner and a cat.\n\n## Right now\n\n- Looking for a new flat by December ([[Flat hunt]])\n- Looking for a senior design role ([[Job hunt]])\n- Renewing the passport in March ([[Passport renewal]])\n\n## How Bower should write\n\n- Short notes, facts first, dates as \"3 Oct\"\n- Money in pounds\n- Never write passport or account numbers\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f96","name":"Rules.md","folder":false,"parents":["f1"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-03T15:39:48.222Z","createdTime":"2026-10-02T15:39:48.222Z","size":722},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: 3 rules Bower follows in every tidy-up.\nby: bower\nkind: Rules\n---\n\n## Rules\n\n- Receipts and invoices for purchases go to Areas / Money / Receipts, in a folder per month of their date (YYYY-MM). <!-- since 2026-10-04 -->\n  *You wrote: \"receipts to money by month\"*\n- Score every job offer from 1 to 10 against CV insights, list the skills it asks for that the CV lacks, and add a row to the Job hunt table. <!-- since 2026-09-30 -->\n  *You wrote: \"score job offers against my cv and tell me what im missing\"*\n- Passports, ID cards and certificates go to Areas / Documents; tick their line in Passport renewal. Never write document numbers. <!-- since 2026-09-30 -->\n  *You wrote: \"keep my id papers together\"*\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f97","name":".bower","folder":true,"parents":["f1"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.319Z","createdTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.319Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f98","name":"changes","folder":true,"parents":["f97"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.320Z","createdTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.320Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f99","name":"questions.json","folder":false,"parents":["f97"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.354Z","createdTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.321Z","size":895},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"{\n  \"v\": 1,\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"q1\",\n      \"text\": \"Flat 3, 12 Larkspur Lane and the new Wrenfield Road listing look like the same building. Keep one note for both?\",\n      \"yes\": \"Yes, merge\",\n      \"no\": \"No, keep both\",\n      \"about\": \"Projects/Flat hunt/Flat 3, 12 Larkspur Lane.md\",\n      \"askedAt\": 1791052788222\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"q2\",\n      \"text\": \"Two receipts from Kittiwake Lettings look like the same holding deposit, paid twice. Keep both?\",\n      \"yes\": \"Keep both\",\n      \"no\": \"Keep one\",\n      \"askedAt\": 1791052788222\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"q-saltmere\",\n      \"text\": \"The Saltmere receipts went to Money by month. Keep a copy of the list in the Saltmere weekend note too?\",\n      \"yes\": \"Yes, keep a copy\",\n      \"no\": \"No, Money is enough\",\n      \"about\": \"Projects/Saltmere weekend/Saltmere weekend.md\",\n      \"askedAt\": 1791225588232\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f100","name":"suggestions.json","folder":false,"parents":["f97"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.32