name":"Deposit return.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f92"],"modifiedTime":"2025-09-20T09:39:48.237Z","createdTime":"2025-09-19T09:39:48.237Z","size":48},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: Deposit return.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f94","name":"Inventory, Hatchmere Road.md","folder":false,"parents":["f92"],"modifiedTime":"2025-08-31T12:39:48.237Z","createdTime":"2025-08-30T12:39:48.237Z","size":268},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Check-out inventory of the previous flat; deposit returned in full.\nstatus: done\ntags: [home]\nkind: Inventory\n---\n\n## Current state\n- Deposit returned in full on 2 September 2025.\n\n## Timeline\n- 2 Sep 2025 · Deposit return filed. · [[Deposit return.pdf]]\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f95","name":"About me.md","folder":false,"parents":["f1"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-05T17:39:48.237Z","createdTime":"2026-09-04T17:39:48.237Z","size":477},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Who Alex is, what matters now and how Bower should write.\nkind: Profile\n---\n\nAlex is an industrial designer in Wrenmouth and lives with a partner and a cat.\n\n## Right now\n\n- Looking for a new flat by December ([[Flat hunt]])\n- Looking for a senior design role ([[Job hunt]])\n- Renewing the passport in March ([[Passport renewal]])\n\n## How Bower should write\n\n- Short notes, facts first, dates as \"3 Oct\"\n- Money in pounds\n- Never write passport or account numbers\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f96","name":"Rules.md","folder":false,"parents":["f1"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-03T15:39:48.237Z","createdTime":"2026-10-02T15:39:48.237Z","size":722},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: 3 rules Bower follows in every tidy-up.\nby: bower\nkind: Rules\n---\n\n## Rules\n\n- Receipts and invoices for purchases go to Areas / Money / Receipts, in a folder per month of their date (YYYY-MM). <!-- since 2026-10-04 -->\n  *You wrote: \"receipts to money by month\"*\n- Score every job offer from 1 to 10 against CV insights, list the skills it asks for that the CV lacks, and add a row to the Job hunt table. <!-- since 2026-09-30 -->\n  *You wrote: \"score job offers against my cv and tell me what im missing\"*\n- Passports, ID cards and certificates go to Areas / Documents; tick their line in Passport renewal. Never write document numbers. <!-- since 2026-09-30 -->\n  *You wrote: \"keep my id papers together\"*\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f97","name":".bower","folder":true,"parents":["f1"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.334Z","createdTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.334Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f98","name":"changes","folder":true,"parents":["f97"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.335Z","createdTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.335Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f99","name":"questions.json","folder":false,"parents":["f97"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.336Z","createdTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.336Z","size":572},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"{\n  \"v\": 1,\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"q1\",\n      \"text\": \"Flat 3, 12 Larkspur Lane and the new Wrenfield Road listing look like the same building. Keep one note for both?\",\n      \"yes\": \"Yes, merge\",\n      \"no\": \"No, keep both\",\n      \"about\": \"Projects/Flat hunt/Flat 3, 12 Larkspur Lane.md\",\n      \"askedAt\": 1791052788237\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"q2\",\n      \"text\": \"Two receipts from Kittiwake Lettings look like the same holding deposit, paid twice. Keep both?\",\n      \"yes\": \"Keep both\",\n      \"no\": \"Keep one\",\n      \"askedAt\": 1791052788237\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f100","name":"suggestions.json","folder":false,"parents":["f97"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.337Z","createdTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.337Z","size":212},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"{\n  \"v\": 1,\n  \"suggestions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"s1\",\n      \"title\": \"Recipes go to Resources / Cooking\",\n      \"why\": \"The last three recipes went there: W