ion form filled in.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f75","name":"Resources","folder":true,"parents":["f1"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.253Z","createdTime":"2025-08-31T18:39:48.253Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f76","name":"Ideas","folder":true,"parents":["f75"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-25T14:39:48.253Z","createdTime":"2026-09-25T14:39:48.253Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f77","name":"Weekend projects.md","folder":false,"parents":["f76"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-25T14:39:48.253Z","createdTime":"2026-09-24T14:39:48.253Z","size":189},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Small things to do on free weekends.\nkind: List\n---\n\n- [ ] Fix the bike's back brake\n- [x] Print the Saltmere photos\n- [ ] Shelf for the hallway\n- [ ] Try the sourdough recipe\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f78","name":"Cooking","folder":true,"parents":["f75"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-04T11:39:48.253Z","createdTime":"2026-10-04T11:39:48.253Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f79","name":"Lemon tart.md","folder":false,"parents":["f78"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-02T18:39:48.253Z","createdTime":"2026-09-01T18:39:48.253Z","size":170},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: A lemon tart for six, written down from a friend.\ntags: [recipe]\nkind: Recipe\n---\n\nBlind-bake the case 15 minutes; the filling sets in 25 minutes at 160 °C.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f80","name":"Weeknight curry.md","folder":false,"parents":["f78"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-04T11:39:48.253Z","createdTime":"2026-10-03T11:39:48.253Z","size":491,"appProperties":{"by":"bower","bowerNew":"1"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: A 30-minute chickpea and spinach curry for four.\ntags: [recipe, vegetarian]\nby: bower\nkind: Recipe\ntime: 30 min\nserves: 4\n---\n\n## Ingredients\n\n- [ ] 2 tins of chickpeas\n- [ ] 200 g spinach\n- [ ] 1 tin of coconut milk\n- [ ] Curry paste, onion, garlic\n\n## Method\n\n1. Soften the onion and garlic.\n2. Fry the paste for a minute.\n3. Add chickpeas and coconut milk; simmer 15 minutes.\n4. Stir in the spinach.\n\n## Timeline\n- Today · Saved from a clipping. · [[curry-clipping.example]]\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f81","name":"Sourdough, the short version.md","folder":false,"parents":["f78"],"modifiedTime":"2026-09-10T08:39:48.253Z","createdTime":"2026-09-09T08:39:48.253Z","size":322,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: A same-day sourdough loaf, 7 hours from mixing to baking.\ntags: [recipe, baking]\nby: bower\nkind: Recipe\ntime: 7 h\n---\n\n1. Mix 500 g flour, 350 g water, 100 g starter, 10 g salt.\n2. Four folds, 30 minutes apart.\n3. Shape, rest 2 hours, bake 45 minutes at 240 °C.\n\n## Timeline\n- 9 Sep · Saved from a blog post.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f82","name":"Manuals","folder":true,"parents":["f75"],"modifiedTime":"2026-07-07T15:39:48.253Z","createdTime":"2026-07-07T15:39:48.253Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f83","name":"Router setup.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f82"],"modifiedTime":"2026-06-07T14:39:48.253Z","createdTime":"2026-06-06T14:39:48.253Z","size":46},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: Router setup.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f84","name":"Dishwasher manual.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f82"],"modifiedTime":"2026-07-07T15:39:48.253Z","createdTime":"2026-07-06T15:39:48.253Z","size":51},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: Dishwasher manual.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f85","name":"Reading","folder":true,"parents":["f75"],"modifiedTime":"2026-08-06T16:39:48.253Z","createdTime":"2026-08-06T16:39:48.253Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f86","name":"Notes that grow.md","folder":false,"parents":["f85"],"modifiedTime":"2026-08-06T16:39:48.253Z","createdTime":"2026-08-05T16:39:48.253Z","size":233},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Notes on the book: write in your own words and link each note to others.\ntags: [reading]\nkind: Book\nauthor: Ida Marrow\n---\n\n- One idea per note\n- Link before you file\n- See also [[Clipping, Four folders for everything]]\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f87","name":"Clipping, Four folders for everything.md","folder":false,"parents":["f85"],"modifiedTime":"2026-07-22T10:39:48.253Z","createdTime":"2026-07-21T10:39:48.253Z","size":209},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: A clipped article on PARA: projects, areas, resources and archive.\ntags: [reading]\nkind: Clipping\n---\n\nProjects have an end; areas go on; resources are for later; the archive is for what is done.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f88","name":"Archive","folder":true,"parents":["f1"],"modifiedTime":"2026-10-05T18:39:48.253Z","createdTime":"2025-08-31T18:39:48.253Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f89","name":"Trips","folder":true,"parents":["f88"],"modifiedTime":"2025-12-09T08:39:48.253Z","createdTime":"2025-12-09T08:39:48.253Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f90","name":"Brackwater 2025.md","folder":false,"parents":["f89"],"modifiedTime":"2025-12-09T08:39:48.253Z","createdTime":"2025-12-08T08:39:48.253Z","size":321,"appProperties":{"by":"bower"}},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"---\nsummary: Four days in Porto in May 2025: what we spent and what we liked.\nstatus: done\ntags: [travel]\nby: bower\nkind: Trip\n---\n\n## Current state\n- Spent £740 in total.\n\nThe old salt works were the highlight; the boat trip was skippable.\n\n## Timeline\n- 30 May 2025 · Receipts filed. · [[Brackwater 2025 receipts.pdf]]\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f91","name":"Brackwater 2025 receipts.pdf","folder":false,"parents":["f89"],"modifiedTime":"2025-12-09T08:39:48.253Z","createdTime":"2025-12-08T08:39:48.253Z","size":58},"trashed":false,"content":{"text":"A made-up pdf for the demo: Brackwater 2025 receipts.pdf.\n"}},{"meta":{"id":"f92","name":"Old flat","folder":true,"parents":["f88"],"modifiedTime":"2025-08-31T12:39:48.253Z","createdTime":"2025-08-31T12:39:48.253Z"},"trashed":false,"content":null},{"meta":{"id":"f93","